1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sigurd was a machinist on several boats, including "Amerikalinjen" (the America line)'s boats Bergensfjord and Tanafjord
2 CONT
2 CONT In June 1917 Sigurd was helping his cousing, Kristian, to build a cabin in Skjeberg, two weeks before his wife was due to give birth (to Knut). As word came that she had given birth, he rowed in to Fredrikstad  and train to Kristi
2 CONC ania to see his first son.
2 CONT
